## :link: The document is the link {.title}

- Tiny Little Office, and a leaner skill for writing it

---

## :lock: How a Tiny Little Office link works

- The whole document lives after the `#` in the URL
- Browsers never send the fragment to a server
- Opening a link gives you an editor on your own copy
- Every edit rewrites the address: the new link is the new version
- No account, no upload, nothing kept unless you choose to

---

## :workflow: From text to link

```diagram
---
kind: lanes
---
- Agent: write TLO text
- Agent: percent-encode it after the hash
- Browser: open the plain link
- Site: pack it into the v1 form
- Reader: edit and send the new link back
```

> TLO is Markdown plus a head, attributes, typed columns, connections and fenced documents from other apps.

