## :wrench: making-tinyoffice-links

- A short SKILL.md that routes you to one reference file per app
- `scripts/tlo.py link` packs the text as the site does, and lints it
- `tlo.py read` turns any link back into its text
- Offline lint: fence-bullets, edge-end, comma-number, length
- Verified: all 15 upstream example links rebuilt byte for byte

---

## :check: This deck is the test

- Written as TLO and built with `tlo.py link deck`
- The lint passed before it was shared
- Edit a slide and the address bar holds your copy
